#8000
"Atop a Knoll before the Gates"
"You are at the summit of a verdant knoll.  All around you to the north, south,

and west below are pine trees that surround the knoll like a fence.  Towering

over you to the east are a pair of immense gates made of sturdy oak and

reinforced with shiny steel.  Palisades that reach heights of over ten feet

stand beside the gates.  Traces of blood and claw marks can be detected on the

barky exterior of the palisades.

"
