west side is a tunnel, on the side opposite is a large door.  On the southern

side of the courtyard is a very wide doorway.  The courtyard has a bit of

plant-life growing up next to the pathways.  In the center is a fountain,

carved, from obsidian, in the likeness of a dark god.

