#8005
"Armory"
"The entrance to this place is wide enough for a pair of wagons.  The front

half of the chamber is an armory, the back, a forge.  So many types and styles

of arms and armor surround you that it would be quite possible to find

anything you'd desire.  A long, low wall separates the two halves of the

building.  The foundry area is large enough to accommodate several smiths at

once, yet one is in attendance.  Several forges, anvils, and troughs are

scattered throughout.  Along the southern wall are bins and crates, all filled

with supplies.  A door leads out the eastern wall, surrounded by practice gear.

"
"[Olah] should there be a repair mob?

"
