#8006
"Guard Room"
"This room has all the markings of military use.  It has some furnishings, all

functional, and some gear, ready to be used.  Standing to either side of the

doorway are weapon racks; swords and the like to the left, polearms and bows

to the right.  There are a few cots along the back wall.  In the back corner

of the room sits a ladder.

"
