#8007
"Great Hall"
"Decorating the walls of this large chamber are many exotic trophies, ranging

from basic to ancient artifacts.  Seven giant pillars support the domed roof

high overhead, each one carved as a totem to a dark god.  The greatest of the

pillars in the center of the room, circled by the other six.  Spaced around

the central pillar are three long tables, hewn of some dark and silvery wood. 

At each table's ends are wineracks or kegs.  Upon the tables, a feast is set,

great haunches of meat resting on platters, surrounded by breads, sweets,

sauces, and wines.  Many tapestries hang down from the high ceiling above,

each depicting an event of triumph.  Against the eastern wall is a large

tapestry, with smaller ones upon the rest of the walls.

"
"[Olah] 5 chair and table objects need to be added

"
