#8010
"Foyer"
"A lavishly appointed chamber with the walls paneled in a light wood, floors of

polished tile.  Many thick, heavy tapestries hang upon the walls.  There are a

few deep pile rugs around the room, seemingly tossed in place.  Built into the

walls are some large shelves which are partially covered with books and

scrolls.  A few chairs and pillows add to the clutter of the room.  Set

against the east wall is a grand staircase.  The stairs are carved from marble

blocks, with railings made out of a golden-toned wood.  To the north is an

ornate door, covered with many detailed carvings.  East, next to the stairway,

lies a heavy, reinforced door.  A button shaped like a skull is situated

beside the door.

"
"[Olah] press button to get into storage room 8023

"
