#8015
"Entrance to the Harem"
"Large mahogany double doors open into this lavish area.  Candles fill this

room, many set upon silver platters and in silver inlaid sconces on the

walls.  The candlelight dances off the polished, dark marble walls, but leaves

much of the room dimly lit.  Many silken pillows in various rich hues are

strewn in piles around the room.  These plush pillows look large enough for

more than one person to share comfortably.  A few silver trays have been left

close at hand, with various bottles of alcohol and crystal glasses upon them. 

Fresh flowers and herbs are used to fill the area with an enticing aroma, and

rose petals have been scattered upon the floor.  To the east, sheer curtains

hang from a large archway, revealing a glimpse of a large pool in the next

room.

"
"pillows, bottles, glass items

