#8016
"A Luxurious Pool"
"A large rectangular pool dominates the center of this room.  The pool is

crafted from the same dark marble as the walls.  Candle light dances over the

top of the water giving it the appearance of golden satin, while below the

surface remains as dark as night.  The water is heated magically, giving off

steam, and keeping this area very warm.  At the far end of the pool stands a

statue of Iniara, The Dark Goddess of Lust.  Water pours into the pool from a

wine pitcher in Iniaras hand, lit by magical means, the water flows blood red

in color.  Pillows are placed along the walls, as well as towels, oils, soaps

and anything else that might be required.  To the north, south and east are

smaller rooms used for changing.  To the west is the archway leading back to

the main area.

"
""
